    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/412e2895139dab8325c6b7c52edb851d.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=136 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/ecc27dc80f0fcc123aac2d2da7010da6.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/ecc27dc80f0fcc123aac2d2da7010da6.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t be scared of what\u2019s in the dark. Or in the walls. Or under the floor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Home Renovation Simulator A house fixing game, filled with mysteries that await the brave souls that dare play it. Tired of cleaning up messes? Feels like neighbors are constantly watching you? Can\u2019t get rid of the strange smell in the basement? Don\u2019t worry! Let us help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/a20ea8cdbc40a3b10774751e92ca99c1.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/a20ea8cdbc40a3b10774751e92ca99c1.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix all kinds of place - and survive to tell the tale!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore all kinds of locations Houses and homes, and broken-down churches! Blood-stained hockey rinks, cultist hideouts, places of demon worship and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/bcf06f52473228516fee33ba87860734.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/bcf06f52473228516fee33ba87860734.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home improvement like never before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair broken floor tiles and electric sockets. Fix up doorways arnd furniture, remove the blood and the gore. Get rid of the bones. Draw the ritual circle. Become the One That Wakes The Mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/aa218e1a02a22a407811284765c039ce.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/aa218e1a02a22a407811284765c039ce.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the aesthetics of the retro era.Fix up houses in that classic, low-poly style!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/412e2895139dab8325c6b7c52edb851d.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=136 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/ecc27dc80f0fcc123aac2d2da7010da6.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/ecc27dc80f0fcc123aac2d2da7010da6.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t be scared of what\u2019s in the dark. Or in the walls. Or under the floor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Home Renovation Simulator A house fixing game, filled with mysteries that await the brave souls that dare play it. Tired of cleaning up messes? Feels like neighbors are constantly watching you? Can\u2019t get rid of the strange smell in the basement? Don\u2019t worry! Let us help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/a20ea8cdbc40a3b10774751e92ca99c1.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/a20ea8cdbc40a3b10774751e92ca99c1.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix all kinds of place - and survive to tell the tale!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore all kinds of locations Houses and homes, and broken-down churches! Blood-stained hockey rinks, cultist hideouts, places of demon worship and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/bcf06f52473228516fee33ba87860734.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/bcf06f52473228516fee33ba87860734.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home improvement like never before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair broken floor tiles and electric sockets. Fix up doorways arnd furniture, remove the blood and the gore. Get rid of the bones. Draw the ritual circle. Become the One That Wakes The Mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/aa218e1a02a22a407811284765c039ce.poster.avif?t=1742910257\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601530/extras/aa218e1a02a22a407811284765c039ce.webm?t=1742910257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the aesthetics of the retro era.Fix up houses in that classic, low-poly style!</p>",
